  ('zcrm_5797994000000569082', 'Cove', NULL, 'Pranav Seshadri', 'David Wolfenden', 'Cove is a gamified banking app designed to make finance engaging and less intimidating. You start with a small island with nothing more than a shed on it. This island is your financial center. Over time you can expand and decorate it by saving and managing your money. You can farm bananas, interact with friends, and collect rare, limited-edition items for your island. To get a decoration, you have to stash money for it - a neat way of making savings a little more fun, and a little less like work. It''s a serious yet fun approach to personal finance, backed by FDIC insurance up to $250k.', 'HV STEM', NULL, 'Fall 2023', NULL, NULL, 'Pranav Seshadri', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023-09-08 08:46:14', '2023-10-06 12:09:58', '2023-10-06 12:09:58'),
