  ('zcrm_5797994000000577109', 'Cell BioEngines', NULL, 'Pranav Seshadri', 'Ajay Vishwakarma', 'About Cell BioEngines / Business Updates:
Within just a few months following Cell BioEngines incorporation (Dec 22, 2022), the company has impressively achieved a USD 1M pre-seed SAFE investment which will convert to a preferred equity interest in the company immediately prior to our next seed-equity financing round of USD 12M to be announced on September 13th , 2023. The company has already received a hard commitment of USD 2M seed investment from SOSV and seeking investors for USD 10M. 
This strong financial momentum, coupled with our comprehensive product pipeline positions us for leadership in cell therapy industry. This raise will fund the following first two products coming to market.
CBE-101, a clinical stage product -> Allogenic Hematopoietic Cell Transplantation for use as a bone marrow replacement tissue in hematological cancers.  
CBE-201, a pre-IND stage product -> Allogenic one size fit-all type 1 dendritic cell (cDC1)-based therapeutic vaccine for solid cancers.
