  ('zcrm_5797994000001592137', 'Chemix', 'Chemix', 'Vihaan Shah', 'Jason Koeller', 'Chemix is an innovative company focused on advancing battery technology, particularly for electric vehicles (EVs) and energy storage systems. They specialize in developing new materials that make lithium-ion batteries more powerful, longer-lasting, and safer. These improvements are critical as the world moves toward cleaner energy and relies more on electric vehicles and renewable energy sources. Chemix’s work is essential in pushing the limits of how far an EV can travel on a single charge and how efficiently we can store renewable energy like solar or wind power.', 'HV Genesis', NULL, 'Fall 2024', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Vihaan Shah', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2024-09-02 12:03:49', '2025-03-21 08:16:11', '2025-03-21 08:16:11'),
