  ('zcrm_5797994000001598297', 'Andros', 'Andros', 'Andrew Carter', 'Laron Burrows', 'Andros is developing a novel reactor to produce ammonia efficiently at atmospheric pressure. The reactor replaces the status-quo Haber-Bosch process for ammonia production. The low-cost energy-efficient reactors that Andros is developing can enable a switch to low-carbon fertilizers, ammonia as a hydrogen carrier, and as a sustainable marine fuels.', 'HV Genesis', NULL, 'Fall 2024', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Andrew Carter', 'On Hold', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2024-09-03 19:02:46', '2025-03-21 08:15:55', '2025-03-21 08:15:55'),
