  ('zcrm_5797994000001598364', 'Coflux Purification', 'Coflux Purification', 'Andrew Carter', 'Alec Ajnsztajn', 'Coflux Purification is developing a photocatalytic reactor to destroy PFAS. This reactor is enabled by the company’s photocatalytic absorbent, a fully organic catalytic system with an exceptionally high internal surface area. This absorbent allows for the removal of PFAS from water. After absorption, UV light triggers a photocatalytic reaction, which breaks down the PFAS into minerals already present in water. This permanently destroys the PFAS, removing them from drinking water and the environment.', 'HV Genesis', NULL, 'Fall 2024', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Andrew Carter', 'On Hold', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2024-09-03 20:23:08', '2025-03-21 08:16:11', '2025-03-21 08:16:11'),
